This package does not contain the slides / documents editor. The app downloads it on its first start (or with
`instructional-agents editor install`) from the GitHub release editor-v<version> of this repository into
~/.cache/instructional-agents/editor/<version>/; IA_EDITOR_DIR can name another build.
The local app serves it to the browser at /editor/. Without it, the app uses the hosted editor at
https://edit.chaxus.com.


Editor (separate program, separate package)
-------------------------------------------

The editor is a trimmed build of ranuts/document (https://github.com/ranuts/document), the web front end that
embeds the ONLYOFFICE document editors:

  * ONLYOFFICE sdkjs and web-apps, Copyright (C) Ascensio System SIA
    https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/sdkjs, https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/web-apps
  * ranuts/document, Copyright (C) its authors

Both are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 (AGPL-3.0) with the additional terms
permitted by its Section 7. The build Instructional Agents distributes is a modified version of ranuts/document
(an embedding API for opening, saving and running macros from the host page, and a build that keeps only the
presentation and document editors). Its complete corresponding source code is published on the editor-src branch
of this repository (https://github.com/DaRL-GenAI/instructional_agents_studio/tree/editor-src), and each editor
release names the commit it was built from (build-identity.json in the archive). The editor carries its own LICENSE
and NOTICE files, which apply to it.

Instructional Agents talks to the editor only through its postMessage interface from a separate page; it does not
link to or include editor code. The MIT license of this package does not apply to the editor.


